{
    "title": "Tile Family\u00ae:Match Puzzle Game",
    "description": "Tile match is an addictive yet challenging mahjong-inspired tile matching game. It will help you to train your brain and calm your anxiety while enjoying the Mahjong puzzles. As with most puzzle games, numerous levels are ready to test you in tile match.\r\n\r\nChallenge your skills with no time and space limitations in Mahjong-puzzles games. If you are a fan of matching puzzle games or Mahjong, you will surely love our tile match game.\r\n\r\nAll you need to do is find and collect three identical tiles, just like in Mahjong. When all tiles are removed from the puzzle board, you win! Once the board is filled with 7 tiles, you lose.\r\n\r\nTile match Features:\r\n- Lots of styles for you to discover: fruits, rainbows, plants, nuts...\r\n- Mahjong-inspired challenging levels and win by collecting 3 tiles\r\n- Hints will help you pass the levels\r\n- Sharpen your brain and kill time with joy\r\n- Online and offline\r\n\r\nDownload and enjoy the never-ending fun of our free tile match! Tile match, with its Mahjong elements, stands tall among puzzle games as your next brain tester!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Tile match is an addictive yet challenging mahjong-inspired tile matching game. It will help you to train your brain and calm your anxiety while enjoying the Mahjong puzzles. As with most puzzle games, numerous levels are ready to test you in tile match.<br><br>Challenge your skills with no time and space limitations in Mahjong-puzzles games. If you are a fan of matching puzzle games or Mahjong, you will surely love our tile match game.<br><br>All you need to do is find and collect three identical tiles, just like in Mahjong. When all tiles are removed from the puzzle board, you win! Once the board is filled with 7 tiles, you lose.<br><br>Tile match Features:<br>- Lots of styles for you to discover: fruits, rainbows, plants, nuts...<br>- Mahjong-inspired challenging levels and win by collecting 3 tiles<br>- Hints will help you pass the levels<br>- Sharpen your brain and kill time with joy<br>- Online and offline<br><br>Download and enjoy the never-ending fun of our free tile match! Tile match, with its Mahjong elements, stands tall among puzzle games as your next brain tester!",
